<section class="page-heading"><span>AFTERGLOW ONLINE / ABOUT US</span><h1>OLD SOUL.<br/><em>NEW HOMEPAGE.</em></h1><p>A love letter to the stuff worth keeping.</p></section>
<div class="inner-content story-layout"><div class="story-photo"><img src={url('images/editorial/grunge-collage.webp')} alt="Grunge fashion inspiration: leather, plaid, denim, and roses" width="1024" height="1536"/><span>FILE: good_taste_forever.jpg</span></div><article class="story-letter"><h2>HEY. WE’RE AFTERGLOW.</h2><p>Our little corner of Indianapolis is for clothes with character and people with their own point of view.</p><p>The worn-in tee. The perfect fade. The thing you didn’t know you were looking for until you found it. We’re into the pieces with a life before yours—and plenty of life left.</p><hr/><h3>1996 attitude. 2026 execution.</h3><p>The internet used to feel like a collection of little worlds. A few links, a questionable background, a whole lot of personality. Consider this our contribution.</p><p>Come for the clothes. Stay for the nostalgia. Wear whatever makes you feel like yourself.</p><a class="retro-button" href={url('shop/')}>Find your next favorite »</a><p class="letter-signoff">see you on the world wide web,<br/><strong>afterglow ✳</strong></p></article></div>
